<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Linxira OS — 面向理学的 Linux 发行版</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0E1417; color: #e5e7eb; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden; }

    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 2rem; background: rgba(14,20,23,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3);
    }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo img { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
    .nav-logo span { color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #20B8B0; }
    .zeta-feature { display: block; text-decoration: none; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: left; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
    .zeta-feature:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(226,6,19,0.5); }
    .zeta-feature h3 { color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .zeta-feature h3 .zeta-mark { color: #E20613; font-weight: 800; }
    .zeta-feature p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .zeta-feature .zeta-go { color: #E20613; font-size: 0.82rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; display: inline-block; }
    .lang-link { background: rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); color: #e2e8f0; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .lang-link:hover { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.2); }

    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 2rem; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -40%; left: -20%; width: 80vw; height: 80vw; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(32,184,176,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%); animation: drift 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate; pointer-events: none; }
    .hero::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -30%; right: -15%; width: 70vw; height: 70vw; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(243,111,93,0.10) 0%, transparent 70%); animation: drift 25s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse; pointer-events: none; }
    @keyframes drift { 0% { transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); } 100% { transform: translate(40px,-30px) scale(1.05); } }
    .grid-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(32,184,176,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(32,184,176,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px; pointer-events: none; }
    .prism-deco { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 80px solid transparent; border-right: 80px solid transparent; border-bottom: 140px solid rgba(32,184,176,0.06); top: 15%; left: 8%; transform: rotate(15deg); pointer-events: none; }
    .prism-deco-2 { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 60px solid transparent; border-right: 60px solid transparent; border-bottom: 100px solid rgba(243,111,93,0.05); bottom: 20%; right: 10%; transform: rotate(-20deg); pointer-events: none; }
    .beam { position: absolute; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(32,184,176,0.15), rgba(243,111,93,0.15), transparent); pointer-events: none; }
    .beam-1 { top: 30%; left: 0; width: 100%; transform: rotate(-5deg); }
    .beam-2 { top: 60%; left: 0; width: 100%; transform: rotate(3deg); }
    .beam-3 { top: 45%; left: 0; width: 100%; transform: rotate(-2deg); opacity: 0.5; }

    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .hero-logo { width: 140px; height: 140px; margin-bottom: 2rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(32,184,176,0.3)); }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #E8F7F6, #F36F5D); background-size: 200% 200%; animation: gradient-shift 6s ease infinite; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    @keyframes gradient-shift { 0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; } 50% { background-position: 100% 50%; } }
    .tagline { font-size: 1.3rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .en-tagline { font-size: 1rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .release-status { max-width: 820px; margin: -1rem auto 2rem; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; }

    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; max-width: 960px; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .feature { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: left; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
    .feature:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .feature h3 { color: #20B8B0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .feature p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; }

    .cta { display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); color: white; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(32,184,176,0.3); }
    .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(32,184,176,0.4); text-decoration: none; }

    .brand-section { position: relative; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0E1417 0%, #1a1f2e 50%, #1e2433 100%); padding: 5rem 0; }
    .brand-section::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(32,184,176,0.3), rgba(243,111,93,0.3), transparent); }
    .section { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
    .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .section-title { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    .section-subtitle { color: #64748b; font-size: 1rem; }
    .section-divider { width: 60px; height: 3px; margin: 1rem auto 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); border-radius: 2px; }

    .subsection-title { color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .subsection-title::before { content: ''; width: 4px; height: 20px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); border-radius: 2px; }

    .logo-display { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .logo-card { border-radius: 16px; padding: 3rem 4rem; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0c1322, #131b2e); }
    .logo-card img { width: 120px; height: 120px; }
    .logo-card .label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 1rem; }

    .palette { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .color-card { border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); transition: transform 0.3s; }
    .color-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .color-swatch { height: 90px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .color-info { background: #1e2433; padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem; }
    .color-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .color-hex { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94a3b8; font-family: monospace; }
    .color-use { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

    .wallpaper-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .wallpaper-card { border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); }
    .wallpaper-card img { width: 100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .wallpaper-label { background: #1e2433; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .wallpaper-tag { font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; }

    .license { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .license h3 { color: #20B8B0; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .license-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .license-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.6rem; padding: 0.6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); }
    .license-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .license-icon { font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .license-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; }
    .license-text strong { color: #e2e8f0; }

    footer { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); background: #0a0f1a; }

    /* Blog section */
    .blog-section { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0f1a 0%, #0E1417 100%); padding: 5rem 0; }
    .blog-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .blog-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; }
    .blog-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .blog-date { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .blog-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .blog-desc { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .blog-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 0.75rem; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) { .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; } .palette { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .wallpaper-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .license-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .logo-display { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; } .blog-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/zh/" class="nav-logo"><img src="/assets/linxira-l.svg" alt="Linxira"><span>Linxira OS</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/zeta/">Zeta</a>
      <a href="/zh/docs/">文档</a>
      <a href="/zh/blog/">博客</a>
      <a href="/zh/legal/license/">协议</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      <a href="/en/" class="lang-link">EN</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>
    <div class="prism-deco"></div>
    <div class="prism-deco-2"></div>
    <div class="beam beam-1"></div>
    <div class="beam beam-2"></div>
    <div class="beam beam-3"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <img src="/assets/linxira-l.svg" alt="Linxira OS" class="hero-logo">
      <h1>Linxira OS</h1>
      <p class="tagline">个人科学工作站</p>
      <p class="en-tagline">基于 Direct Arch 的桌面超算环境</p>
      <p class="release-status">Linxira OS 直接基于 Arch Linux 构建。第一个<strong>测试版</strong> ISO(2026.08.04)已通过完整安装测试——自研软件全部可正常安装、启动/关机 logo 与 fastfetch 字符画已定稿、签名 <code>[linxira]</code> 软件仓库可让 pacman 追踪自研软件更新。ISO 下载链接将随公开发布放出;与此同时一切均可从源码复现构建(见 <a href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/packages/blob/main/RELEASE.md" style="color:#20B8B0;">RELEASE.md</a>)。</p>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature"><h3>Direct Arch 桌面</h3><p>KDE Plasma、Arch 官方仓库、官方双内核与 Btrfs 恢复共同构成工作站基础。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><h3>Welcome + catalog v2</h3><p>Live 桌面自动打开 Welcome，并展示与 Config Hub、Calamares 共用的 catalog v2 审核配置。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><h3>手动启动安装</h3><p>Live 会话保持完整 Plasma 桌面；准备好后从 Welcome 或应用菜单手动启动 Calamares。</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><h3>安装后使用 Shelly</h3><p>Shelly 在安装后管理 Arch 软件包和可选来源，不参与安装器事务。</p></div>
      </div>
      <a href="/zeta/" class="zeta-feature"><h3><span class="zeta-mark">Z</span> Zeta — 终端编码代理</h3><p>在终端里运行编码代理：多提供商模型、工具调用、原生加速、可嵌入 TUI。OMP 兼容发行版。</p><span class="zeta-go">探索 Zeta →</span></a>
      <a href="/zh/docs/" class="cta">阅读当前文档</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Blog -->
  <section class="blog-section">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">最新动态</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">项目公告和技术文章</p>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="blog-grid">
        <a href="/zh/blog/introducing-linxira-os/" class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-date">2026-06-27</div>
          <div class="blog-title">Linxira OS 介绍</div>
          <div class="blog-desc">Linxira OS 是什么，为谁而建，为什么要做这个项目。设计理念、技术架构和目标用户。</div>
          <span class="blog-tag">公告</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brand-section" id="brand">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">品牌资产</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Scale L 由参考坐标轴、科学刻度与珊瑚色测量终点构成</p>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subsection-title">主标识</h3>
      <div class="logo-display">
        <div class="logo-card"><img src="/assets/linxira-l.svg" alt="Linxira Scale L"><div class="label">Canonical Scale L — 深色背景</div></div>
        <div class="logo-card" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a2f3a,#343a47);"><img src="/assets/linxira-l-mono.svg" alt="Linxira L Mono"><div class="label">单色版 — 灰色背景</div></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subsection-title">配色方案</h3>
      <div class="palette">
        <div class="color-card"><div class="color-swatch" style="background:#20B8B0; color:#0E1417;">主色</div><div class="color-info"><div class="color-name">仪器青绿</div><div class="color-hex">#20B8B0</div><div class="color-use">主标识与科学仪器感</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-card"><div class="color-swatch" style="background:#F36F5D; color:#0E1417;">终点</div><div class="color-info"><div class="color-name">珊瑚红</div><div class="color-hex">#F36F5D</div><div class="color-use">测量终点与行动强调色</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-card"><div class="color-swatch" style="background:#0E1417; color:#E8F7F6;">轴线</div><div class="color-info"><div class="color-name">深墨色</div><div class="color-hex">#0E1417</div><div class="color-use">参考轴与深色背景</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-card"><div class="color-swatch" style="background:#E8F7F6; color:#0E1417;">刻度</div><div class="color-info"><div class="color-name">浅水色</div><div class="color-hex">#E8F7F6</div><div class="color-use">科学刻度与浅色细节</div></div></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subsection-title">壁纸预览</h3>
      <div class="wallpaper-grid">
        <div class="wallpaper-card"><img src="/assets/linxira-wallpaper.svg" alt="深色壁纸"><div class="wallpaper-label"><span>深色壁纸</span><span class="wallpaper-tag">1920×1080</span></div></div>
        <div class="wallpaper-card"><img src="/assets/linxira-wallpaper-light.svg" alt="浅色壁纸"><div class="wallpaper-label"><span>浅色壁纸</span><span class="wallpaper-tag">1920×1080</span></div></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subsection-title">终端字符画</h3>
      <div class="charart" style="background:#0a0f13; border:1px solid #263238; border-radius:12px; padding:1.2rem 1.5rem; overflow-x:auto; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <pre style="font-family:Consolas,'Noto Sans Mono',ui-monospace,monospace; font-size:13px; line-height:1.4; color:#20B8B0; margin:0; white-space:pre;">                                
                                
       ⢀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⠁⡄⠀⠀⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⣀⢰⢀⢀⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⠉⠉⠉⠁⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⣄⣠⡀⠀⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⠁⢸⠀⠀⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⠦⡁⠤⠄⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⠁⢸⠀⠀⢀                  
       ⢀⠀⠓⠚⠂⠀⢀⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛⠛    
       ⢀⠀⠁⢸⠀⠀⢀⡀⠀⠀⣀⠀⠀⢀⡀⠀⠀⠁⠀⠀⠀    
       ⢀⠀⢀⠓⠒⠒⠂⠐⠒⠒⠁⠒⠒⠂⠐⠒⠒⠿⠀⠀⠀    
       ⢀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀    
                                
                                </pre>
        <p style="color:#94a3b8; font-size:0.85rem; margin-top:0.8rem;">盲文点阵 60×16 终端字符画,基于权威 Scale&nbsp;L 标记用 Chafa 生成。终端以仪器青绿(#20B8B0)渲染。资产文件: <a href="/assets/linxira-logo-braille60.ansi">linxira-logo-braille60.ansi</a> · 来源: <a href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-artwork">linxira-artwork</a></p>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subsection-title">资产使用条例</h3>
      <div class="license">
        <div class="license-grid">
          <div class="license-item"><span class="license-icon">📜</span><div class="license-text"><strong>政策:</strong> Linxira 品牌资产保留全部权利</div></div>
          <div class="license-item"><span class="license-icon">✅</span><div class="license-text"><strong>允许:</strong> 未修改的 Linxira OS 随附分发</div></div>
          <div class="license-item"><span class="license-icon">✅</span><div class="license-text"><strong>允许:</strong> 媒体报道、评测引用</div></div>
          <div class="license-item"><span class="license-icon">❌</span><div class="license-text"><strong>禁止:</strong> 暗示非官方项目的官方关联</div></div>
          <div class="license-item"><span class="license-icon">❌</span><div class="license-text"><strong>禁止:</strong> 修改后用于其他发行版</div></div>
          <div class="license-item"><span class="license-icon">❌</span><div class="license-text"><strong>禁止:</strong> 未授权商业使用</div></div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem;"><a href="/zh/legal/brand-assets/">阅读完整品牌资产政策 →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer><p>Linxira OS 直接基于 Arch Linux 构建，是与 Arch Linux 无隶属关系且未经其官方认可的独立项目。</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
